    <statement><p>Find an equation of a plane containing the three points
(-2, 3, 0), (-3, 5, -4), (-3, 6, -2) in which the coefficient of <m>x</m> is 8.</p>
<p><fillin characters="60" name="AnSwEr0001"/> = 0.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>8\mathopen{}\left(x-\left(-2\right)\right)+2\mathopen{}\left(y-3\right)+\left(-1\right)\mathopen{}\left(z-0\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
